# Daniels' graveyard ability is paid by putting the card itself from the graveyard on the bottom of the library (CR 118.3),
# so once Tormod's Crypt has exiled it, it can't be activated from exile: the card is no longer where the cost takes it
# from (CR 113.6m, 602.2b). Bot1 gains no life.

